r":"Codex（AI 代理）","surfaces":["項伯"],"evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:p009","quote":"淮南王至，上方踞床洗，召布入見，布（甚）大怒，悔來，欲自殺。出就舍，帳御飲食從官如漢王居，布又大喜過望。於是乃使人入九江。楚已使項伯收九江兵，盡殺布妻子。布使者頗得故人幸臣，將眾數千人歸漢。漢益分布兵而與俱北，收兵至成皋。四年七月，立布為淮南王，與擊項籍。"}]}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:p009","text":"淮南王至，上方踞床洗，召布入見，布（甚）大怒，悔來，欲自殺。出就舍，帳御飲食從官如漢王居，布又大喜過望。於是乃使人入九江。楚已使項伯收九江兵，盡殺布妻子。布使者頗得故人幸臣，將眾數千人歸漢。漢益分布兵而與俱北，收兵至成皋。四年七月，立布為淮南王，與擊項籍。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m009-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"淮南王","kind":"person","person_id":"dsv_qg0_ete","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m009-0005","start":5,"end":6,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"x7a_os4_5d8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m009-0012","start":12,"end":13,"surface":"布","kind":"person","person_id":"dsv_qg0_ete","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m009-0016","start":16,"end":17,"surface":"布","kind":"person","person_id":"dsv_qg0_ete","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m009-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"x7a_os4_5d8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m009-0045","start":45,"end":46,"surface":"布","kind":"person","person_id":"dsv_qg0_ete","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m009-0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"項伯","kind":"person","person_id":"0oi_5wz_q0n","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m009-0073","start":73,"end":74,"surface":"布","kind":"person","person_id":"dsv_qg0_ete","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m009-0077","start":77,"end":78,"surface":"布","kind":"person","person_id":"dsv_qg0_ete","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m009-0082","start":82,"end":86,"surface":"故人幸臣","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","